    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f846551bfe4f41f803b5d1b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "的确是如评价那般有趣的剧目呢。\n被突然的巨响吓得跳起来的二人，真的非常可爱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9fcde2193c1be3eba790b73668002e8ad2f5b0789e07839881284d3d1815123",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071006.json",
      "json_path": [
