    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9359b5e7d18863d17709b3bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……直到结局为止都没能见到幽灵的真容，实在有些遗憾。\n若是换作我的话，我一定会再度返回城堡，寻找幽灵的踪迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eea652febea347ce6eb652fe8a521f65312037d38f71f407390eb6e8630e219f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
