    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31dea80c80a2a6aeb83f316a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我想要和它一起享用红茶、一起谈天说地。\n它一直住在城堡里，一定对城堡这悠长的历史了如指掌——",
      "source_fingerprint": "979c4b47c156e629734fd6ae5966db1b999a57f2bd33a30db69fafdcd5f2ba16",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
