    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cfc971010af3614c8adead",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若是这样的话……即便是已然被历史遗忘的某人，\n也能在瞬间重新绽放光辉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "245134513baf5f2302b841a186cffd2835b9aef88d9541e2866debe8ddc10b79",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
