    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e50bb20f370bf2b979cfc15",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时候，我会化身为男孩子；有时候则会化身为老婆婆。\n有时候会进行妙趣横生的冒险，有时候则会因为恶作剧而被责骂。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caa2f8f63cb6222b334d73a11722ec9a6f617a123efd7e522ba67336b6a38c28",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ca0762d1947756880d8ef68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那现在的话，会把自己想象成那位骑士吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dae2d787b8c61671d7f6f733f9f49f0aad119e854b8943523abe9d6f6292c22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
