    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfec8cc3108a6c0727e4433",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是谁，都会在想象中改变自己原本仅有一次的人生吧。\n就像是某种秘密的小游戏，我觉得非常有趣哦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5853e7abc444358bd8a2848d60ee8f7403368c7e927a5929f79ecf5d6ac70c4a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1071/storytimeline_041071006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4450c2d847c01e16d2e38e9a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仅仅观察而已吗？",
